    <name>Media Storage</name>
    <summary>Private virtual media organization using Nextcloud files</summary>
    <description>Owner-isolated virtual buckets, folders and media references with a responsive Material explorer and scoped external API tokens. Session uploads and previews are supported; revocable temporary media access is supported. Single-range streaming, conditional delivery and configurable abuse controls are supported.</description>
